  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Two inductors <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> are connected in parallel and a time varying current flows as shown in figure. The ratio ot current <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></math> at any ime <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math> Is<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/e395eb82-c1b7-4c9b-8cae-857766929c90-image.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 174px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "k510b",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9rQAK",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cgjBl",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "j5Ngi",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
